<title>USA: CKS Group buys Donovan and Green.</title>
<headline>CKS Group buys Donovan and Green.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated marketing communications company CKS Group Inc said Monday it had signed a definitive agreement to acquire 100 percent of Donovan and Green Inc of New York, which specializes in marketing communications.</p>
<p>CKS Group said it would pay in cash and common stock for the company without disclosing the price.</p>
<p>It said the company would operate as a wholly-owned subsidiary under the Donovan and Green name.</p>
<p>CKS Group is based in Cupertino, California.</p>
